<title>USA: Samsung extends tender for AST.</title>
<headline>Samsung extends tender for AST.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsung Electronics Co Ltd said Monday it has extended its cash tender to acquire all outstanding shares AST Research Inc it doesn't already own for $5.40 a share.</p>
<p>The offer, which was to expire Monday, will now expire June 17 unless further extended, Samsung said.</p>
<p>Samsung said 26,698,266 shares, or about 85 percent of the outstanding shares not owned by Samsung, had been tendered as of Monday.</p>
<p>Consummation of the tender offer remains subject to approval by the government of the Republic of Korea.</p>
</text>
